---
source: crates/biome_html_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: invalid.html
---
# Input
```html
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->

<button></button>

<button>   </button>

<menuitem></menuitem>

<!-- `aria-hidden="false"` is still exposed — a label is still required. -->
<button aria-hidden="false"></button>

<!-- An empty labeling attribute is not a real label. -->
<button aria-label=""></button>

<!-- A hidden child does not supply an accessible label. -->
<button><span aria-hidden="true">Delete</span></button>

<!-- Element names are matched case-insensitively in `.html` files. -->
<BUTTON></BUTTON>

<!-- A decorative image supplies no accessible name. -->
<button><img src="close.png" alt="" /></button>

<!-- Void elements supply no accessible name. -->
<button><br /></button>

<!-- A hidden input supplies no accessible name. -->
<button><input type="hidden" /></button>

```

# Diagnostics
